  "body_preview": "Private wealth's allocation to alternatives is expected to grow from about $4 trillion to $13 trillion by 2032.",
  "body": "Dear Clients, Colleagues and Friends,\n\nI hope you are having a wonderful week!\n\nWe have a bunch of upcoming Uncorrelated events starting with Dublin & London in September, followed by my personal favorite in October, AltsOps in NYC...then we head to Cayman in November and we get right back to where it all started in Miami for 2027!!!\n\nPlease reach out of you have any interest in sponsoring and/or attending any of our upcoming conferences.\n\nLet's keep the ball rolling by staying connected with U-Alts by Uncorrelated!!!\n\nA diligence-enabled alternative investment platform of LP Investors and Fund Managers...please reach out for more information or register here!\n\nLastly, don't forget that we continue to roll out Virtual 1-on-1 Meetings - Connecting Fund Managers and LP Investors Across the Alternative Investment Landscape!\n\nFor more info and to get registered please us the link below.\n\nManager Registration\n\nLP Investor Registration\n\nIf you have any questions don't hesitate to reach out.\n\nAlso, if you are a Service Provider and have interest in participating in our events, please reach out as we have sponsorship opportunities available.\n\nHave an amazing week!\n\nBest,\nAnthony\n\nAnthony D. Mascia\nManaging Member\n\nEssential Fund Services International, LLC\nMain Line: 646.948.6500\nToll Free: 877.456.EFSI (3374)\nFax Line: 877.978.EFSI (3374)\nDirect: 646.948.6504\nMobile: 917.597.3562\nEmail: adm@essentialfsi.com\nWebsite: www.essentialfsi.com\n\nBe kind, for everyone you meet is fighting a hard battle.\n-Plato\n\nDisclaimer: The information in this email, and in any files transmitted with it, is intended for use by the named addressee/s only and may contain confidential and/or privileged material. If you are not the intended recipient or have received this email in error, please contact the sender and delete the material from any computer. Any disclosure, copying, distribution or any action taken or omitted to be taken in reliance on such material is strictly prohibited. You should carry out your own virus check before opening any attachment; Essential Fund Services International, LLC accepts no liability for any loss or damage which may be caused by software viruses or interception/interruption of this email. The views and opinions expressed in this e-mail are those of the sender, and do not necessarily reflect those of Essential Fund Services International, LLC.",
  "has_attachments": false,
  "folder": "Inbox"
 },
