  "body_preview": "Summary: MTD: -12.14%, YTD: 13.65%",
  "body": "Hi Jinghan, Please access the latest factsheet of Daoyi Equity Long Short Fund. Quick summary: July MTD: -12.14%, 2026 YTD: 13.65%. Commentary: July 2026 was the second monthly drawdown since the Fund's launch. The Fund navigated previous market shocks with limited impact, but the July AI-led correction affected the portfolio more meaningfully. The drawdown reflected the normalization of unusually elevated unrealized gains rather than a deterioration in the Fund's discount-capture engine. Following the July experience, the investment team has enhanced its risk management framework. Best regards, William Shek CFA FRM, Senior Advisor of Sales.",
